WEBVTT

00:00:06.610 --> 00:00:09.530
Rosia! Are you Rosia?!

00:00:13.370 --> 00:00:15.160
Help!

00:00:17.080 --> 00:00:19.410
Rosia, I'm going to help you now!

00:00:19.620 --> 00:00:21.540
What are you all doing?

00:00:21.750 --> 00:00:23.920
Capture Cyan!

00:00:44.860 --> 00:00:47.440
Rosia, stop it!

00:00:51.740 --> 00:00:52.900
Cyan!

00:00:56.450 --> 00:00:57.450
Darudayu!

00:00:57.660 --> 00:00:59.370
Cyan, now!

00:00:59.580 --> 00:01:02.580
Believe in yourself and release your power!

00:01:03.710 --> 00:01:04.750
But...

00:01:04.960 --> 00:01:06.920
I can't do it alone...

00:01:13.340 --> 00:01:15.180
Leave it to me!

00:01:20.770 --> 00:01:22.230
Shu☆zo!

00:01:23.230 --> 00:01:25.730
Shu! Nice!

00:01:28.480 --> 00:01:29.980
Everyone!

00:01:38.620 --> 00:01:39.790
Cyan!

00:01:39.790 --> 00:01:41.330
<i>I'm fine even by myself</i>

00:01:41.540 --> 00:01:43.870
<i>That's what I thought</i>

00:01:43.870 --> 00:01:44.710
Cyan!

00:01:44.870 --> 00:01:44.920
<i>But the next thing I knew</i>

00:01:44.920 --> 00:01:46.420
Let's go!

00:01:46.420 --> 00:01:46.460
<i>But the next thing I knew</i>

00:01:46.630 --> 00:01:46.670
Pyuru!

00:01:46.670 --> 00:01:47.790
<i>Noise spread in my heart</i>

00:01:48.000 --> 00:01:48.960
Everyone...

00:01:49.670 --> 00:01:51.550
<i>...I was pretending to be strong</i>

00:01:51.760 --> 00:01:55.470
<i>I couldn't find the courage</i>

00:01:55.680 --> 00:01:59.140
<i>To take that first step</i>

00:01:59.350 --> 00:02:01.930
<i>Wandering around in a maze</i>

00:02:02.140 --> 00:02:06.140
<i>My heart is astir</i>

00:02:06.350 --> 00:02:09.440
<i>The destiny I suddenly came into contact with</i>

00:02:09.650 --> 00:02:13.610
<i>The melodies of the two of them that resonated</i>

00:02:13.820 --> 00:02:20.620
<i>The strength that even made</i>
<i>me forget I was looking down</i>

00:02:20.830 --> 00:02:24.120
<i>Just as long as you're there</i>

00:02:24.330 --> 00:02:25.580
<i>I can be strong</i>

00:02:25.790 --> 00:02:28.210
<i>I won't hesitate anymore</i>

00:02:28.420 --> 00:02:30.670
<i>I can see it now</i>

00:02:30.880 --> 00:02:36.930
<i>We're there, in the future</i>

00:02:58.030 --> 00:02:59.950
Cyan...

00:03:00.160 --> 00:03:01.700
Rosia...

00:03:02.490 --> 00:03:04.540
Everyone...

00:03:05.290 --> 00:03:06.330
Cyan...

00:03:06.540 --> 00:03:09.500
This can't be true... Don't tell me Cri-Cri...

00:03:09.710 --> 00:03:12.290
...was the dark monster, pyuru?

00:03:17.050 --> 00:03:21.180
Cyan... We...

00:03:21.390 --> 00:03:24.970
Yeah, you were taken in by the monster.

00:03:26.890 --> 00:03:31.810
It's probably because I kept saying
mean things to you and the others...

00:03:32.020 --> 00:03:34.570
...that we turned into a monster...

00:03:37.360 --> 00:03:38.990
I'm sorry...

00:03:39.200 --> 00:03:42.240
It's okay. Come on, can you stand?

00:03:42.450 --> 00:03:44.120
Yeah...

00:03:44.330 --> 00:03:45.120
Rosia...

00:03:45.330 --> 00:03:47.080
I was so scared...

00:03:47.290 --> 00:03:52.670
Um, Cyan. Thank you for saving us.

00:03:53.380 --> 00:03:56.380
Everyone, I'm glad you're okay...

00:04:14.020 --> 00:04:16.110
Could that be Dagger?!

00:04:16.320 --> 00:04:17.440
What?!

00:04:17.650 --> 00:04:19.400
It's a monster!

00:04:19.610 --> 00:04:21.700
I can't take it anymore!

00:04:27.240 --> 00:04:31.870
You should have just behaved
and did as you were told.

00:04:32.080 --> 00:04:35.630
Now that it's come to this,
I'll use everything that I have.

00:04:48.430 --> 00:04:50.810
President, let's hurry on.

00:04:51.020 --> 00:04:53.560
You're right, let's.

00:05:03.240 --> 00:05:04.780
This is...?

00:05:12.410 --> 00:05:14.170
Help!

00:05:14.370 --> 00:05:15.630
Rosia!

00:05:15.830 --> 00:05:18.380
Damn it! What happened?

00:05:24.180 --> 00:05:25.590
Cyan!

00:05:25.800 --> 00:05:30.270
With your power, you can't win
no matter how much you struggle.

00:05:30.470 --> 00:05:32.930
I have gotten my hands
on the most powerful song.

00:05:33.140 --> 00:05:38.110
Because I am the music emperor
that Midi City will bow down to!

00:05:58.000 --> 00:06:00.250
Let's go, President!

00:06:00.750 --> 00:06:02.760
Please do it gently...

00:06:06.510 --> 00:06:09.470
Angelica, Angelica, Angelica, Angelica...!

00:06:36.040 --> 00:06:38.170
It looks like the studio is up ahead.

00:06:40.090 --> 00:06:41.040
President...

00:06:41.250 --> 00:06:42.800
It seems we've been discovered.

00:06:44.210 --> 00:06:48.180
Of course we have. You were so noisy...

00:06:48.390 --> 00:06:49.970
Let's charge straight through!

00:06:50.180 --> 00:06:51.720
Arisugawa...!

00:07:04.820 --> 00:07:06.280
Excuse me...

00:07:09.160 --> 00:07:14.200
This city of Myumons who love music,
Midi City, can only be satisfied with your music,

00:07:14.410 --> 00:07:17.660
and your music alone.

00:07:17.870 --> 00:07:22.170
Could anything make you happier?

00:07:22.380 --> 00:07:26.380
I-I don't want that kind of happiness!

00:07:26.590 --> 00:07:29.930
That's right! Cyan is a member of Plasmagica!

00:07:30.140 --> 00:07:32.550
We won't let her go to you!

00:07:32.760 --> 00:07:35.140
Go away, and don't come back, pyuru!

00:07:35.810 --> 00:07:38.230
Shut up, scum!

00:07:39.640 --> 00:07:41.770
Stop it!

00:07:42.360 --> 00:07:43.440
Hm?

00:07:43.860 --> 00:07:47.940
All... all right...

00:07:48.150 --> 00:07:53.240
I... I'll do as you say...

00:07:54.870 --> 00:07:56.790
Seriously?

00:07:59.330 --> 00:08:02.170
You made a wise decision, Cyan.

00:08:02.380 --> 00:08:04.790
I'm glad you understand.

00:08:05.630 --> 00:08:08.470
Now, for the contract.

00:08:19.020 --> 00:08:20.520
Cyan!

00:08:35.280 --> 00:08:37.240
Rock 'n' roll!

00:09:01.810 --> 00:09:03.480
What happened...?

00:09:04.770 --> 00:09:06.770
Sorry to keep you waiting!

00:09:25.500 --> 00:09:28.130
Th-That's... it can't be...!

00:09:29.880 --> 00:09:32.840
That legendary super rock guitarist...

00:09:33.050 --> 00:09:35.090
Grateful King!

00:09:42.100 --> 00:09:43.270
Cyan!

00:09:43.480 --> 00:09:44.850
I'm glad you're okay.

00:09:45.060 --> 00:09:46.600
Everything's settled now, pyuru!

00:09:46.810 --> 00:09:48.310
Yeah.

00:09:52.320 --> 00:09:54.780
Grateful King...!

00:09:54.990 --> 00:09:55.950
What?!

00:09:56.160 --> 00:09:59.030
Don't get in my way!

00:10:08.170 --> 00:10:11.090
I don't need you anymore.

00:10:11.300 --> 00:10:14.050
Just behave yourself over there.

00:10:14.260 --> 00:10:17.340
This guy... had this much power...?

00:10:21.510 --> 00:10:24.140
Now, Cyan. Let us continue.

00:10:24.350 --> 00:10:26.690
Nothing will get in our way <i>this</i> time.

00:10:26.890 --> 00:10:32.110
Come with me and take over the world!

00:10:36.200 --> 00:10:37.740
Cyan!

00:10:47.870 --> 00:10:51.290
King... bastard...!

00:10:51.500 --> 00:10:53.050
Cyan!

00:10:53.920 --> 00:11:00.470
Cyan, sorry for forcing you
into dangerous situations...

00:11:01.300 --> 00:11:07.690
Even though the real you
hates fighting and has a kind heart...

00:11:07.890 --> 00:11:09.690
That voice...

00:11:09.900 --> 00:11:12.690
Could you be... Mr. Berry?!

00:11:12.900 --> 00:11:18.070
I won't let you get hurt anymore...

00:11:18.280 --> 00:11:20.490
This is goodbye, Cyan...

00:11:20.700 --> 00:11:23.370
The days I spent with you... weren't bad...

00:11:23.580 --> 00:11:25.080
Huh?

00:11:26.790 --> 00:11:28.250
Mr. Berry!

00:11:41.800 --> 00:11:44.060
Cyan's going home, pyuru!

00:11:44.260 --> 00:11:47.480
She's going back to her own world...

00:11:55.900 --> 00:12:00.070
We have to take care of
the rest ourselves somehow!

00:12:01.570 --> 00:12:04.120
Everyone... run away...

00:12:04.330 --> 00:12:06.410
There's no way you can win...!

00:12:09.830 --> 00:12:11.960
You're pathetic, Dagger!

00:12:13.380 --> 00:12:17.550
Bastard! I'll never forgive you!

00:12:22.640 --> 00:12:28.430
In that case, I'll get rid
of every last one of you!

00:12:30.140 --> 00:12:32.520
Okay, let's go, everyone!

00:12:32.730 --> 00:12:35.190
Let's protect <i>our</i> Midi City!

00:12:36.440 --> 00:12:39.400
I haven't changed at all.

00:12:39.610 --> 00:12:43.360
I'm always, always just scared.

00:12:43.570 --> 00:12:46.030
What was the point of all this...?

00:12:49.500 --> 00:12:52.870
No! I can't go home yet!

00:13:00.090 --> 00:13:05.640
<i>Falling star of dreams shining in the night sky</i>

00:13:05.850 --> 00:13:13.480
<i>Watching it, singing,</i>
<i>letting it carry these feelings</i>

00:13:21.440 --> 00:13:22.650
What?!

00:13:23.490 --> 00:13:28.530
I can't just leave everyone
like this and go home!

00:13:33.960 --> 00:13:34.620
Cyan... you...

00:13:34.620 --> 00:13:36.210
<i>Counting the lights</i>
Cyan... you...

00:13:36.210 --> 00:13:37.130
<i>Counting the lights</i>

00:13:37.340 --> 00:13:39.880
<i>Of the stars quietly</i>

00:13:40.090 --> 00:13:45.260
<i>Hiding my sorrow</i>

00:13:45.470 --> 00:13:45.800
<i>Have you noticed?</i>

00:13:45.800 --> 00:13:47.850
This is it for you, Dagger!

00:13:48.550 --> 00:13:50.430
<i>Just thinking about you</i>

00:13:50.640 --> 00:13:50.770
<i>Makes my heart hurt</i>

00:13:50.770 --> 00:13:52.430
Prepare yourself!

00:13:52.430 --> 00:13:55.270
<i>Makes my heart hurt</i>

00:13:55.480 --> 00:13:58.020
<i>I can't sleep</i>

00:13:58.230 --> 00:13:59.770
<i>Nights like this</i>

00:13:59.980 --> 00:14:02.240
<i>Oh, just let me</i>

00:14:02.440 --> 00:14:06.110
<i>Have one wish</i>

00:14:06.320 --> 00:14:11.240
<i>Falling star of dreams shining in the night sky</i>

00:14:11.450 --> 00:14:16.830
<i>I want to see it from the same place as you</i>

00:14:17.040 --> 00:14:20.670
<i>No matter how far apart we are</i>

00:14:20.880 --> 00:14:28.300
<i>Our hearts will one day become one</i>

00:14:30.350 --> 00:14:32.010
That was great, kitten!

00:14:32.220 --> 00:14:33.560
Well done.

00:14:33.770 --> 00:14:36.140
Is it... over...?

00:14:39.230 --> 00:14:40.230
Ow!

00:14:42.900 --> 00:14:44.570
Damn it!

00:14:46.400 --> 00:14:47.360
That's what you get!

00:14:47.570 --> 00:14:50.660
You should learn from this
and stop doing bad things!

00:14:50.870 --> 00:14:52.450
Ow! Ow!

00:14:55.960 --> 00:14:57.790
Remember this, stupid!

00:14:58.000 --> 00:14:59.130
He ran away!

00:14:59.330 --> 00:15:00.840
Leave him.

00:15:01.040 --> 00:15:03.960
He can't do anything looking like that.

00:15:04.170 --> 00:15:05.630
Hmph!

00:15:14.100 --> 00:15:15.850
Cyan!

00:15:16.350 --> 00:15:17.690
I'm so glad!

00:15:17.890 --> 00:15:20.860
If you left before I could even say goodbye...

00:15:21.060 --> 00:15:24.030
I would've resented you forever!

00:15:24.230 --> 00:15:26.150
Retoree...

00:15:28.240 --> 00:15:29.820
Cyan!

00:15:33.830 --> 00:15:37.960
Your guitar playing was great.

00:15:38.160 --> 00:15:40.000
Mr. Berry!

00:15:40.210 --> 00:15:43.250
"Mr. Berry"? What's she saying?

00:15:43.460 --> 00:15:46.670
She doesn't know that legendary Grateful King?

00:15:46.880 --> 00:15:49.300
He <i>is</i> Mr. Berry.

00:15:49.510 --> 00:15:49.970
Huh?

00:15:50.180 --> 00:15:55.680
He transferred his own consciousness
to possess Strawberry Heart.

00:15:55.890 --> 00:15:59.770
I'm that "perverted guitar bastard," darling!

00:15:59.980 --> 00:16:02.310
What?

00:16:04.110 --> 00:16:06.230
Man, it can't be helped.

00:16:06.440 --> 00:16:09.650
It is a truth that shocks even
the only god of the universe.

00:16:09.860 --> 00:16:13.240
It is too much for a rodent to handle.

00:16:13.450 --> 00:16:16.580
Hence, it is too cruel a reality.

00:16:18.250 --> 00:16:22.500
Mr. Berry, I mean, Mr. Grateful King!

00:16:22.710 --> 00:16:26.210
Um, thank you for everything...

00:16:26.420 --> 00:16:29.670
You encouraged me so much...

00:16:30.800 --> 00:16:31.760
Idiot.

00:16:31.970 --> 00:16:35.720
I'm the one who needs to thank <i>you.</i>

00:16:37.060 --> 00:16:40.980
You worked hard, Cyan.

00:16:41.190 --> 00:16:43.560
No, that's not it.

00:16:43.770 --> 00:16:46.230
I was scared the whole time.

00:16:47.610 --> 00:16:53.660
But because everyone was here...
because I wasn't alone...

00:16:54.660 --> 00:16:57.620
Really... thank you...

00:16:59.250 --> 00:17:02.080
Thank <i>you</i>, pyuru.

00:17:02.500 --> 00:17:04.880
Thanks, Cyan.

00:17:08.340 --> 00:17:10.970
Oh, I almost forgot.

00:17:11.170 --> 00:17:12.340
Hm?

00:17:13.340 --> 00:17:16.470
Here's a present from me!

00:17:16.680 --> 00:17:17.600
Wow...

00:17:17.810 --> 00:17:18.720
Picks?

00:17:18.930 --> 00:17:19.930
Yes!

00:17:20.140 --> 00:17:21.930
Even for me?

00:17:22.140 --> 00:17:23.560
So we can all match!

00:17:23.770 --> 00:17:25.310
Pyuru!

00:17:39.330 --> 00:17:42.250
Thank you, Chuchu!

00:17:45.540 --> 00:17:46.830
Sure!

00:18:00.350 --> 00:18:01.890
We finally made it...

00:18:02.850 --> 00:18:06.350
Hakkun, the compass in your head was
too messed up by the city's magnetic field...

00:18:06.560 --> 00:18:09.360
I can't believe we wandered
around lost for three hours!

00:18:09.570 --> 00:18:12.650
Sorry... Midi City's real scary...

00:18:12.860 --> 00:18:17.490
Aw, the festival's already over...
This is the pits...

00:18:17.700 --> 00:18:19.950
You're late, high schoolers!

00:18:20.830 --> 00:18:24.160
Jeez, how long are you gonna make me wait?

00:18:24.370 --> 00:18:25.290
Oh, the old guy!

00:18:25.500 --> 00:18:28.130
Don't call me "old guy"! Call me Mr. Ogasawara!

00:18:28.330 --> 00:18:31.840
Oh? I thought I hadn't seen you for a while...

00:18:32.050 --> 00:18:36.470
Now you're planning on tricking
these innocent high schoolers?

00:18:36.680 --> 00:18:38.340
Don't make me sound like a bad person!

00:18:38.550 --> 00:18:41.260
I'm just telling the truth!

00:18:47.310 --> 00:18:50.270
Now, everyone! Let's start this festival again!

00:18:50.270 --> 00:18:50.560
♪ Ready... 1, 2, 3, GO! ♪
Now, everyone! Let's start this festival again!

00:18:50.560 --> 00:18:52.230
♪ Ready... 1, 2, 3, GO! ♪

00:18:52.440 --> 00:18:55.070
♪ Love life! Very! Very! Happy! ♪

00:18:55.280 --> 00:18:55.490
♪ Friendship life! Bouncing, jumping! ♪

00:18:55.490 --> 00:18:56.740
The festival's still going on!

00:18:56.740 --> 00:18:56.950
♪ Friendship life! Bouncing, jumping! ♪

00:18:56.950 --> 00:18:57.400
Let's go!

00:18:57.400 --> 00:18:57.610
♪ Friendship life! Bouncing, jumping! ♪

00:18:57.610 --> 00:18:57.740
Midi City's amazin'!

00:18:58.740 --> 00:18:58.950
♪ Adventure life! Heart-pounding, OK? ♪

00:18:58.950 --> 00:19:00.490
C'mon, let's run for it!

00:19:00.490 --> 00:19:00.570
♪ Adventure life! Heart-pounding, OK? ♪

00:19:00.780 --> 00:19:03.660
♪ Song of youth! Come on ready? Let's go! ♪

00:19:04.330 --> 00:19:06.160
Grateful King!

00:19:06.160 --> 00:19:06.370
♪ Turn your drive on ♪

00:19:06.370 --> 00:19:06.620
It's amazing to be able to
have a jam session with you!

00:19:06.620 --> 00:19:09.170
♪ Let's overtake the shining wind ♪

00:19:09.250 --> 00:19:09.380
- Calm down a bit, Crow.
- Legend!

00:19:09.380 --> 00:19:11.790
♪ With tears? With smiles? Tinged with drama ♪

00:19:14.840 --> 00:19:15.050
What you're doing is incomprehensible.
It will not touch anyone's heartstrings. Hence—

00:19:16.130 --> 00:19:16.340
♪ Vision of love, innocent girl ♪

00:19:17.550 --> 00:19:17.760
Puny rodent, your ant-like brain
looks like it's breaking down. Fool...

00:19:17.760 --> 00:19:20.300
♪ We'll meet people based on intuition! ♪

00:19:20.300 --> 00:19:20.510
Puny rodent, your ant-like brain
looks like it's breaking down. Fool...

00:19:20.510 --> 00:19:24.850
♪ In full bloom, with sweet feelings à la mode ♪

00:19:25.060 --> 00:19:28.020
♪ The boy I like ♪

00:19:28.230 --> 00:19:30.810
♪ His feelings for me increased suddenly ♪

00:19:31.020 --> 00:19:33.610
♪ Push, or pull? Which should I do? ♪

00:19:33.820 --> 00:19:38.860
♪ My heart's beating violently!
There might be some rapid developments! ♪

00:19:39.070 --> 00:19:41.280
♪ From here, I'll jump! ♪

00:19:41.490 --> 00:19:42.200
♪ So, we'll always ♪

00:19:42.410 --> 00:19:45.080
♪ Keep dreaming! Keep singing! ♪

00:19:45.290 --> 00:19:46.950
♪ Our youth is non-stop! ♪

00:19:47.160 --> 00:19:49.330
♪ Go for the endless future! ♪

00:19:49.540 --> 00:19:50.830
♪ Right now's the best ♪

00:19:51.040 --> 00:19:52.630
♪ Shine in the spotlight! ♪

00:19:52.840 --> 00:19:53.710
♪ The earth spins and shakes,
sparkling today, too ♪

00:19:53.710 --> 00:19:56.380
Cyan, thanks to you,
I now know what is most important!

00:19:56.380 --> 00:19:58.340
♪ We're full of spirit! ♪

00:19:58.340 --> 00:19:58.550
Cyan, thanks to you,
I now know what is most important!

00:19:58.550 --> 00:20:00.550
♪ Piling on infinite sounds ♪

00:20:01.470 --> 00:20:01.680
Even if we're apart,
we'll always be friends, right?

00:20:01.680 --> 00:20:03.140
♪ Let's start something! ♪

00:20:03.140 --> 00:20:03.350
Even if we're apart,
we'll always be friends, right?

00:20:03.350 --> 00:20:05.260
♪ Music sensation! ♪

00:20:05.470 --> 00:20:06.770
Cyan!

00:20:06.770 --> 00:20:07.520
♪ Music sensation! ♪

00:20:07.850 --> 00:20:14.190
I love Plasmagica, pyuru!
Cyan, I love you, pyuru!

00:20:14.400 --> 00:20:20.780
I've always, always loved music, but thanks
to you guys, I've come to love it even more!

00:20:20.990 --> 00:20:24.740
What I really want is to
stay with everyone and—

00:20:27.290 --> 00:20:30.080
♪ 1, 2, 3, echo around the world ♪

00:20:30.290 --> 00:20:32.330
♪ These actions definitely can't be stopped ♪

00:20:32.540 --> 00:20:33.920
♪ Climbing on the notes on the music staff ♪

00:20:34.130 --> 00:20:35.290
♪ Exceeding the highest volume ♪

00:20:35.500 --> 00:20:37.630
♪ Let's go with high spirits! ♪

00:20:37.840 --> 00:20:39.380
♪ Step all right, right now ♪

00:20:39.550 --> 00:20:39.590
President?!

00:20:39.590 --> 00:20:40.630
♪ Speed up ♪

